    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage your mind with Consonance, a puzzle game featuring procedurally-generated, animated, minimalist scenes. Rearrange the pieces to reveal each unique scene, and challenge yourself with puzzles containing up to 100 pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750640/extras/61f23f51dc06ffca00292beb9b0dd475.poster.avif?t=1752819698\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750640/extras/61f23f51dc06ffca00292beb9b0dd475.webm?t=1752819698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750640/extras/61f23f51dc06ffca00292beb9b0dd475.mp4?t=1752819698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERSONALIZE YOUR EXPERIENCE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gallery of 37 levels</strong>: Choose from a collection of 37 animated, minimalist scenes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tailor the challenge</strong>: Adjust the difficulty by choosing the number of pieces, from an easy 4-piece to a demanding 100-piece puzzle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soothing soundscapes</strong>: Set the mood with a selection of 10 background tracks produced by Ovani Sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage your mind with Consonance, a puzzle game featuring procedurally-generated, animated, minimalist scenes. Rearrange the pieces to reveal each unique scene, and challenge yourself with puzzles containing up to 100 pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750640/extras/61f23f51dc06ffca00292beb9b0dd475.poster.avif?t=1752819698\" width=500 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750640/extras/61f23f51dc06ffca00292beb9b0dd475.webm?t=1752819698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750640/extras/61f23f51dc06ffca00292beb9b0dd475.mp4?t=1752819698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PERSONALIZE YOUR EXPERIENCE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gallery of 37 levels</strong>: Choose from a collection of 37 animated, minimalist scenes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tailor the challenge</strong>: Adjust the difficulty by choosing the number of pieces, from an easy 4-piece to a demanding 100-piece puzzle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soothing soundscapes</strong>: Set the mood with a selection of 10 background tracks produced by Ovani Sound.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
